1
00:01:33,009 --> 00:01:38,200
[First Love Again]

2
00:01:38,410 --> 00:01:40,930
[Episode 19]

3
00:01:41,810 --> 00:01:44,340
[Jiangcheng University]

4
00:01:45,420 --> 00:01:46,780
Xinyi disappears

5
00:01:46,780 --> 00:01:48,450
the second vacation rolls around.

6
00:01:48,450 --> 00:01:51,060
Xinyi has to go back
to relieve her lovesickness.

7
00:01:51,060 --> 00:01:52,060
Understandable.

8
00:01:52,530 --> 00:01:54,810
Youyou,
what are you doing for summer break?

9
00:01:54,810 --> 00:01:56,140
Summer break?

10
00:01:56,140 --> 00:01:57,970
I've got live streams every single day.

11
00:01:57,970 --> 00:02:00,200
It's not just streams, is it?

12
00:02:00,250 --> 00:02:01,800
You'll also be video‑calling Chen Yu,

13
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:03,600
to soothe that longing of yours.

14
00:02:04,090 --> 00:02:05,860
You're always talking about others.

15
00:02:05,860 --> 00:02:09,410
I think you and Sirui are the ones
who need to relieve your lovesickness.

16
00:02:09,410 --> 00:02:11,440
If it weren't for the team's training,

17
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:14,440
you two would definitely
be stuck together every day.

18
00:02:14,900 --> 00:02:17,900
Li Sirui is going back to my hometown
with me this time.

19
00:02:18,790 --> 00:02:19,980
Really?

20
00:02:21,790 --> 00:02:23,250
Why are you looking at me like that?

21
00:02:23,250 --> 00:02:24,500
It won't delay his training.

22
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:26,230
It's just for two or three days.

23
00:02:26,650 --> 00:02:28,620
Our situation is different from yours.

24
00:02:28,620 --> 00:02:30,750
We've known each other for four years.

25
00:02:30,900 --> 00:02:32,780
Besides, before I came to Jiangcheng,

26
00:02:32,780 --> 00:02:33,850
my dad told me

27
00:02:33,850 --> 00:02:35,250
that if I got a boyfriend,

28
00:02:35,250 --> 00:02:37,180
I should bring him back to meet him.

29
00:02:37,780 --> 00:02:39,020
So I'm just

30
00:02:39,020 --> 00:02:41,850
giving them a head‑start to bond
with their future son‑in‑law.

31
00:02:41,850 --> 00:02:43,180
It's not a bad thing.

32
00:02:44,220 --> 00:02:45,940
You usually seem so carefree.

33
00:02:46,060 --> 00:02:47,500
I didn't expect you to think so far ahead

34
00:02:47,500 --> 00:02:49,250
when it comes to relationships.

35
00:02:49,250 --> 00:02:50,940
The only one being driven
back to her hometown

36
00:02:50,940 --> 00:02:52,850
is Xiangxiang.

37
00:02:53,090 --> 00:02:54,650
I didn't ask him to drive me.

38
00:02:55,370 --> 00:02:57,700
I know. It's hard to refuse such kindness.

39
00:03:05,340 --> 00:03:06,020
Come on.

40
00:03:29,500 --> 00:03:30,620
Xiaotao is back.

41
00:03:30,940 --> 00:03:31,900
Mom.

42
00:03:31,930 --> 00:03:34,180
I was planning to surprise Dad.

43
00:03:34,530 --> 00:03:36,490
You didn't even tell us
you were coming back.

44
00:03:36,490 --> 00:03:37,570
Doesn't matter. I'm here now.

45
00:03:37,570 --> 00:03:38,329
You silly girl.

46
00:03:38,329 --> 00:03:38,980
Dad.

47
00:03:40,940 --> 00:03:42,070
I missed you so much.

48
00:03:42,090 --> 00:03:44,480
-I missed you too.
-Don't you miss your mom?

49
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:45,770
I missed you too, Mom.

50
00:03:47,820 --> 00:03:50,079
Xiaotao, you're having so much fun
out there,

51
00:03:50,079 --> 00:03:51,430
do you even remember your mom and me?

52
00:03:51,430 --> 00:03:53,150
Of course I remember.

53
00:03:53,180 --> 00:03:56,440
Xiaotao, this must be Sirui.

54
00:03:56,870 --> 00:03:57,960
Come on in.

55
00:03:59,430 --> 00:04:00,440
Dad, Mom.

56
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:02,280
This is my boyfriend,

57
00:04:02,530 --> 00:04:03,370
Li Sirui.

58
00:04:03,370 --> 00:04:04,230
Hello, Mrs. Le.

59
00:04:04,990 --> 00:04:06,590
Sorry to trouble you, Mr. Le.

60
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:10,450
See? He even brought you gifts.

61
00:04:11,090 --> 00:04:13,150
It's just a small token of my respect.

62
00:04:13,340 --> 00:04:14,300
Oh, kid.

63
00:04:14,300 --> 00:04:15,810
You shouldn't have.

64
00:04:15,810 --> 00:04:17,740
Exactly. Come on in.

65
00:04:17,940 --> 00:04:19,250
-Let me take it.
-It's okay. I'll do it.

66
00:04:19,250 --> 00:04:20,209
-Let me.
-Come on.

67
00:04:20,209 --> 00:04:21,810
Come on in. Come on in.

68
00:04:23,330 --> 00:04:24,000
Come.

69
00:04:30,960 --> 00:04:33,180
Are you sure you want me
to drop you off here?

70
00:04:33,180 --> 00:04:34,450
It's just right ahead.

71
00:04:34,659 --> 00:04:35,790
I'll walk by myself.

72
00:04:38,100 --> 00:04:39,500
Didn't forget anything?

73
00:04:49,130 --> 00:04:50,330
Text me later, okay?

74
00:04:50,380 --> 00:04:52,220
You text me too.

75
00:04:52,250 --> 00:04:53,780
Drive safe on your way back.

76
00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:55,450
I'm off.

77
00:05:27,220 --> 00:05:28,020
Grandma Zeng.

78
00:05:28,450 --> 00:05:29,680
Xiangxiang, you are back.

79
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:31,040
I'm on summer vacation.

80
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:31,840
Good, good.

81
00:05:31,870 --> 00:05:33,800
Spend more time with your parents.

82
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:34,940
I'll get going.

83
00:05:34,940 --> 00:05:35,620
Okay.

84
00:05:50,930 --> 00:05:51,610
Dad.

85
00:05:53,440 --> 00:05:54,700
Our girl's back.

86
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:55,880
Our girl's back!

87
00:05:56,840 --> 00:05:57,830
Sweetheart.

88
00:05:58,950 --> 00:06:00,380
Weren't you taking the train tomorrow?

89
00:06:00,380 --> 00:06:01,370
Why are you back today?

90
00:06:01,370 --> 00:06:02,620
I hitched a ride with a friend,

91
00:06:02,620 --> 00:06:03,810
so I came a day early.

92
00:06:03,890 --> 00:06:05,000
Welcome home.

93
00:06:06,100 --> 00:06:07,500
Mom.

94
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:09,670
Wait, my apron is covered in oil.

95
00:06:10,860 --> 00:06:12,420
You're already in college.

96
00:06:12,420 --> 00:06:13,890
Why are you still acting like a child?

97
00:06:13,890 --> 00:06:14,860
No matter how old I get,

98
00:06:14,860 --> 00:06:16,190
I'll always be your kid.

99
00:06:16,770 --> 00:06:17,450
Come here.

100
00:06:17,810 --> 00:06:19,470
Let Dad take a good look at you.

101
00:06:23,110 --> 00:06:24,240
You've lost weight.

102
00:06:26,530 --> 00:06:28,860
Why?
Can't you afford to eat as a streamer?

103
00:06:28,890 --> 00:06:30,210
Not at all.

104
00:06:30,540 --> 00:06:32,210
The way I look on camera
is already a little different

105
00:06:32,210 --> 00:06:33,740
from how I look in real life.

106
00:06:34,940 --> 00:06:36,400
Let me show you something.

107
00:06:44,140 --> 00:06:44,909
What is this?

108
00:06:44,490 --> 00:06:45,250
[Certificate of Honor]

109
00:06:45,330 --> 00:06:47,460
[The Starry Sky
Anchor Trainee Program Plan]

110
00:06:45,740 --> 00:06:48,980
This is The Starry Sky's
anchor trainee program plan.

111
00:06:49,420 --> 00:06:50,420
That means

112
00:06:50,570 --> 00:06:52,130
when I graduate,

113
00:06:52,130 --> 00:06:54,100
I can directly join The Starry Sky

114
00:06:54,100 --> 00:06:55,960
and become an official streamer.

115
00:06:56,130 --> 00:06:57,300
You mean

116
00:06:57,500 --> 00:06:59,740
you'll have a job right after graduation?

117
00:06:59,740 --> 00:07:00,450
Well?

118
00:07:00,740 --> 00:07:02,670
Admit it, our daughter is amazing.

119
00:07:04,300 --> 00:07:04,980
Not bad.

120
00:07:05,500 --> 00:07:07,210
Perfect timing.

121
00:07:07,300 --> 00:07:08,620
Your mom cooked your favorites today,

122
00:07:08,620 --> 00:07:09,810
sea bass and shrimp.

123
00:07:10,180 --> 00:07:11,770
Later, our whole family

124
00:07:11,890 --> 00:07:13,010
will celebrate properly.

125
00:07:13,010 --> 00:07:16,420
I knew my mom is the best.

126
00:07:18,330 --> 00:07:19,010
Here.

127
00:07:19,420 --> 00:07:20,740
Have you not been eating well

128
00:07:20,740 --> 00:07:21,890
at school?

129
00:07:21,940 --> 00:07:23,540
Look how thin you've gotten.

130
00:07:24,060 --> 00:07:25,130
Let me tell you.

131
00:07:25,450 --> 00:07:26,980
No blind dieting allowed.

132
00:07:27,450 --> 00:07:28,450
Got it, Dad.

133
00:07:28,450 --> 00:07:29,620
Right, no dieting.

134
00:07:31,250 --> 00:07:31,860
Here.

135
00:07:31,860 --> 00:07:33,300
-The dishes are all here.
-You should go eat too.

136
00:07:33,300 --> 00:07:35,060
-Okay, thank you.
-Thank you, Ms. Wang.

137
00:07:35,060 --> 00:07:36,370
Then I'll dig in.

138
00:07:37,250 --> 00:07:38,010
Xiaotao.

139
00:07:39,300 --> 00:07:40,700
Mind your table manners.

140
00:07:46,300 --> 00:07:48,010
Sirui, help yourself.

141
00:07:48,420 --> 00:07:50,180
Our family doesn't have that many rules.

142
00:07:50,180 --> 00:07:51,240
Thank you, Mrs. Le.

143
00:07:53,970 --> 00:07:56,409
How are you two getting along at school?

144
00:07:59,170 --> 00:08:00,500
Dad, we are doing great.

145
00:08:00,570 --> 00:08:02,290
He always takes good care of me.

146
00:08:02,290 --> 00:08:04,090
Xiaotao takes care of me more.

147
00:08:04,570 --> 00:08:05,300
Sirui.

148
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:07,820
Thank you for taking care of our Xiaotao.

149
00:08:08,010 --> 00:08:10,130
Now I see why she pushed herself so hard

150
00:08:10,130 --> 00:08:11,240
to get into Jiangcheng University.

151
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:13,380
Mom, let's eat. Let's eat.

152
00:08:13,620 --> 00:08:15,350
Okay, let's eat.

153
00:08:17,370 --> 00:08:18,170
Sirui.

154
00:08:19,130 --> 00:08:21,570
What do your parents do?

155
00:08:24,310 --> 00:08:27,360
My father works
at an electrical‑motor factory.

156
00:08:27,980 --> 00:08:29,330
And my mother

157
00:08:29,620 --> 00:08:31,550
works in the restaurant business.

158
00:08:35,380 --> 00:08:36,990
A very down-to-earth family.

159
00:08:36,990 --> 00:08:38,179
-Yes, indeed.
-Dad.

160
00:08:38,179 --> 00:08:39,970
Let's eat. The food's getting cold.

161
00:08:39,970 --> 00:08:41,510
We can talk about this later.

162
00:08:41,510 --> 00:08:42,549
Okay, let's eat.

163
00:08:42,730 --> 00:08:44,490
Let's raise our glasses

164
00:08:44,570 --> 00:08:46,210
to welcome Sirui to our home.

165
00:08:46,210 --> 00:08:47,540
-Thank you.
-Come on.

166
00:08:47,540 --> 00:08:48,300
-Cheers.
-Welcome.

167
00:08:48,300 --> 00:08:49,020
Cheers.

168
00:09:10,490 --> 00:09:12,940
I was just discussing tactics
with Coach Pei.

169
00:09:12,940 --> 00:09:14,600
Sorry I didn't get back to you.

170
00:09:26,420 --> 00:09:28,880
Kunzhou hasn't changed much. That's great.

171
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:32,330
I'll show you around sometime.

172
00:09:33,180 --> 00:09:35,140
Sure. How are things at home?

173
00:09:43,300 --> 00:09:44,430
Everything is fine.

174
00:09:45,260 --> 00:09:47,140
I really missed my mom's cooking.

175
00:09:47,210 --> 00:09:48,610
I ate two big bowls today.

176
00:09:52,140 --> 00:09:55,400
Then don't forget the taste
of the deluxe instant noodles.

177
00:10:06,260 --> 00:10:07,260
I miss you so much.

178
00:10:10,030 --> 00:10:11,190
I miss you too.

179
00:10:37,330 --> 00:10:38,060
Sirui,

180
00:10:38,810 --> 00:10:41,170
try the new tea I got.

181
00:10:41,250 --> 00:10:43,130
I picked it up at the World Expo.

182
00:10:45,730 --> 00:10:46,490
Try it.

183
00:10:48,100 --> 00:10:49,100
Thank you, Mr. Le.

184
00:10:53,140 --> 00:10:54,070
It's delicious.

185
00:10:55,570 --> 00:10:56,630
What are your plans

186
00:10:57,330 --> 00:10:58,490
for the future?

187
00:10:59,780 --> 00:11:02,440
Mr. Le,
I want to play professional basketball.

188
00:11:03,810 --> 00:11:04,610
Sirui,

189
00:11:05,180 --> 00:11:06,330
do you know why

190
00:11:07,330 --> 00:11:09,260
I've worked and struggled so hard?

191
00:11:15,380 --> 00:11:16,260
Because

192
00:11:17,210 --> 00:11:18,450
I want my family

193
00:11:18,940 --> 00:11:21,470
to never suffer the hardships
I went through.

194
00:11:21,660 --> 00:11:22,720
Do you understand?

195
00:11:23,940 --> 00:11:25,300
Mr. Le, I understand.

196
00:11:25,900 --> 00:11:27,450
I am serious about Xiaotao.

197
00:11:27,940 --> 00:11:29,070
I won't let her down,

198
00:11:29,900 --> 00:11:31,360
and I won't let her suffer.

199
00:11:32,730 --> 00:11:33,850
I believe that.

200
00:11:34,900 --> 00:11:36,430
I don't mean anything by it.

201
00:11:37,210 --> 00:11:38,420
I'm not saying

202
00:11:38,420 --> 00:11:40,880
we're against the two of you
being together.

203
00:11:41,260 --> 00:11:42,660
I heard that you now

204
00:11:42,730 --> 00:11:44,780
put most of your energy and time

205
00:11:44,850 --> 00:11:46,450
into basketball games.

206
00:11:47,420 --> 00:11:48,730
Then I want to ask you,

207
00:11:50,420 --> 00:11:51,690
do you think

208
00:11:52,180 --> 00:11:53,580
just playing basketball

209
00:11:53,780 --> 00:11:55,610
can bring our Xiaotao

210
00:11:56,540 --> 00:11:58,210
a happy and stable life?

211
00:12:06,260 --> 00:12:07,900
Here, have some tea.

212
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:40,460
Did my parents make you uncomfortable?

213
00:12:41,070 --> 00:12:41,830
Not at all.

214
00:12:41,860 --> 00:12:43,290
They are very nice to me.

215
00:12:44,210 --> 00:12:44,970
That's good.

216
00:12:48,490 --> 00:12:50,810
This show is too boring.
Let's change the channel.

217
00:12:50,810 --> 00:12:53,180
[Jiangcheng TV]

218
00:12:53,660 --> 00:12:56,060
Basketball. You like it. Let's watch this.

219
00:12:57,570 --> 00:12:58,900
Nice play!

220
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:04,410
[Jiangcheng TV]

221
00:13:05,420 --> 00:13:07,180
Girls, I'm back.

222
00:13:07,180 --> 00:13:09,140
When are we hanging out?

223
00:13:09,490 --> 00:13:11,900
-Hello.
-We know that when you sign players,

224
00:13:09,780 --> 00:13:10,790
[Jiangcheng TV]

225
00:13:11,900 --> 00:13:13,520
you have your own selection criteria.

226
00:13:13,520 --> 00:13:15,080
[Jiangcheng TV]

227
00:13:13,660 --> 00:13:15,300
Seeing the players under your management

228
00:13:15,300 --> 00:13:16,540
all doing so well,

229
00:13:16,610 --> 00:13:18,140
do you have anything to say?

230
00:13:18,690 --> 00:13:19,970
Our company has always been committed to

231
00:13:19,970 --> 00:13:21,450
discovering young talents

232
00:13:21,450 --> 00:13:23,780
and giving them a bigger and better stage.

233
00:13:23,970 --> 00:13:25,490
Look, just like these two,

234
00:13:25,800 --> 00:13:27,710
they both have great potential.

235
00:13:27,740 --> 00:13:29,940
Of course, we can't bury their talents.

236
00:13:30,180 --> 00:13:32,560
You could say we go all out to train them.

237
00:13:32,680 --> 00:13:35,090
At the same time, we welcome more players

238
00:13:35,090 --> 00:13:36,090
to join us.

239
00:13:42,090 --> 00:13:42,970
What's wrong?

240
00:13:44,490 --> 00:13:45,180
Nothing.

241
00:13:49,690 --> 00:13:50,660
Okay, okay, okay.

242
00:13:50,660 --> 00:13:52,660
See you tomorrow at the usual place.

243
00:13:56,450 --> 00:13:57,490
If you're bored at home,

244
00:13:57,490 --> 00:13:58,490
hit us up anytime.

245
00:13:59,020 --> 00:14:00,970
We must treat you well in Kunzhou.

246
00:14:00,970 --> 00:14:01,660
Okay.

247
00:14:01,940 --> 00:14:02,660
You guys head back first.

248
00:14:02,660 --> 00:14:03,860
I'm heading off. Bye.

249
00:14:13,180 --> 00:14:13,850
Hello?

250
00:14:14,610 --> 00:14:15,610
Finished eating?

251
00:14:17,260 --> 00:14:18,180
How was it?

252
00:14:19,060 --> 00:14:20,090
It was pretty good.

253
00:14:20,090 --> 00:14:21,140
We haven't seen each other in a long time,

254
00:14:21,140 --> 00:14:22,380
so it was a good chance to catch up.

255
00:14:22,380 --> 00:14:23,330
Are you sure

256
00:14:23,570 --> 00:14:25,090
you weren't a third wheel?

257
00:14:25,380 --> 00:14:26,490
Of course not.

258
00:14:28,690 --> 00:14:29,380
Then

259
00:14:30,690 --> 00:14:33,450
why did the couple leave hand in hand,

260
00:14:33,730 --> 00:14:34,790
while you look like

261
00:14:35,300 --> 00:14:36,560
you're not very happy?

262
00:14:38,900 --> 00:14:39,810
Walking alone,

263
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:41,100
isn't that even worse?

264
00:14:47,090 --> 00:14:47,820
Turn around.

265
00:15:44,780 --> 00:15:46,850
This surprise is so sudden.

266
00:15:47,330 --> 00:15:48,510
Last night you said you missed me,

267
00:15:48,510 --> 00:15:50,350
and I missed you too, so I came.

268
00:15:51,180 --> 00:15:52,330
What about Tian?

269
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:53,330
I've already asked for leave.

270
00:15:53,330 --> 00:15:55,390
There's not much to do these two days.

271
00:15:57,140 --> 00:15:59,000
Well, since you're already here,

272
00:15:59,140 --> 00:16:00,140
should I fulfill

273
00:16:00,140 --> 00:16:01,670
my promise from last night?

274
00:16:02,630 --> 00:16:04,470
I'm all yours for these two days.

275
00:16:17,610 --> 00:16:18,540
Isn't this

276
00:16:18,660 --> 00:16:20,990
the compound we lived in
when we were kids?

277
00:16:21,610 --> 00:16:23,010
Since you're in Kunzhou,

278
00:16:23,060 --> 00:16:25,260
I definitely had to bring you back here.

279
00:16:32,890 --> 00:16:34,750
We used to play here after school.

280
00:17:33,250 --> 00:17:34,180
Do you remember?

281
00:17:39,450 --> 00:17:40,290
Vaguely.

282
00:17:40,730 --> 00:17:42,820
Didn't we draw here?

283
00:17:43,290 --> 00:17:44,770
I drew a little sheep,

284
00:17:44,820 --> 00:17:46,350
and you drew a big gray wolf.

285
00:17:50,290 --> 00:17:52,420
Later, the big gray wolf disappeared.

286
00:17:54,660 --> 00:17:55,580
After you left,

287
00:17:55,580 --> 00:17:57,100
I was sad for quite a while.

288
00:18:04,940 --> 00:18:06,580
Actually, I really regret it.

289
00:18:06,580 --> 00:18:07,660
For over ten years,

290
00:18:07,860 --> 00:18:09,900
so many people have been by your side,

291
00:18:09,900 --> 00:18:10,960
but I wasn't there.

292
00:18:12,100 --> 00:18:12,760
From now on,

293
00:18:13,820 --> 00:18:15,350
I will be with you every day.

294
00:18:39,250 --> 00:18:40,910
We agreed on every single day.

295
00:18:41,340 --> 00:18:42,690
Not one day less.

296
00:19:06,580 --> 00:19:07,380
What's wrong?

297
00:19:08,490 --> 00:19:10,690
I suddenly feel it's a bit unreal.

298
00:19:11,150 --> 00:19:13,500
I was alone when I went to college.

299
00:19:13,620 --> 00:19:15,220
Now that I'm back in Kunzhou,

300
00:19:15,450 --> 00:19:16,530
I have you with me.

301
00:19:18,210 --> 00:19:19,970
I didn't expect that
coming back this time,

302
00:19:19,970 --> 00:19:21,230
I'd have you by my side,

303
00:19:21,970 --> 00:19:24,700
getting to revisit
all these old spots together.

304
00:19:29,770 --> 00:19:30,660
Then...

305
00:19:30,970 --> 00:19:32,370
head back and rest early.

306
00:19:32,690 --> 00:19:34,220
I'll come see you tomorrow.

307
00:20:02,730 --> 00:20:03,620
Let me carry it.

308
00:20:03,690 --> 00:20:05,100
I saw Xiangxiang is back.

309
00:20:05,100 --> 00:20:05,820
Yes, she is.

310
00:20:05,820 --> 00:20:07,350
School's out for vacation.

311
00:20:07,640 --> 00:20:08,690
Does she have a boyfriend?

312
00:20:08,690 --> 00:20:09,250
No.

313
00:20:09,290 --> 00:20:10,960
She's still young. She can date
after graduating from college.

314
00:20:10,960 --> 00:20:11,680
Right.

315
00:20:15,220 --> 00:20:16,220
Xiangxiang?

316
00:20:20,900 --> 00:20:21,790
I...

317
00:20:22,280 --> 00:20:23,910
Dad, Mom.

318
00:20:24,970 --> 00:20:26,010
-No.
-Well…

319
00:20:41,910 --> 00:20:43,000
I'm leaving.

320
00:20:48,660 --> 00:20:49,990
Goodbye, Grandma Zeng.

321
00:21:00,820 --> 00:21:01,770
Hey you...

322
00:21:02,340 --> 00:21:03,010
Your hands!

323
00:21:03,940 --> 00:21:05,870
Where are you putting them? Let go!

324
00:21:08,580 --> 00:21:09,760
I'm all grown‑up now.

325
00:21:09,760 --> 00:21:11,560
Are you still pulling that on me?

326
00:21:11,730 --> 00:21:12,660
Grown‑up or not,

327
00:21:12,940 --> 00:21:14,600
you'll always be my daughter.

328
00:21:15,140 --> 00:21:16,870
You still won't listen, you...

329
00:21:16,900 --> 00:21:18,140
-Alright, alright.
-Hands!

330
00:21:18,140 --> 00:21:19,210
Let go!

331
00:21:19,820 --> 00:21:22,100
That's enough. Sit down.

332
00:21:23,620 --> 00:21:25,150
Can't we just talk this out?

333
00:21:25,250 --> 00:21:26,290
Why hit her?

334
00:21:28,010 --> 00:21:30,600
Tell us, how far have you two gone?

335
00:21:31,660 --> 00:21:32,820
What do you mean how far?

336
00:21:32,820 --> 00:21:33,950
You know what I mean!

337
00:21:34,290 --> 00:21:36,490
It's not what you think, okay?

338
00:21:36,490 --> 00:21:37,690
What else could it be?

339
00:21:37,860 --> 00:21:38,860
What more do you want?

340
00:21:38,860 --> 00:21:40,180
We saw what you were doing just now!

341
00:21:40,180 --> 00:21:41,450
He is my boyfriend.

342
00:21:44,530 --> 00:21:47,260
He came all the way from Jiangcheng
just to see me.

343
00:21:47,860 --> 00:21:48,590
Xiangxiang.

344
00:21:48,900 --> 00:21:50,140
If you two are in a normal relationship,

345
00:21:50,140 --> 00:21:51,670
your dad and I won't object.

346
00:21:52,580 --> 00:21:53,860
Do you really know him?

347
00:21:54,140 --> 00:21:55,730
What if he's a bad guy?

348
00:21:55,730 --> 00:21:56,860
Just now, you two...

349
00:21:57,340 --> 00:21:58,650
Look at you...

350
00:21:58,770 --> 00:21:59,900
Mr. Zhou, Mrs. Zhou.

351
00:22:00,510 --> 00:22:01,370
I'm not a bad guy.

352
00:22:01,370 --> 00:22:02,300
I am Gu Xiaoli.

353
00:22:04,100 --> 00:22:05,050
Gu Xiaoli?

354
00:22:05,220 --> 00:22:07,220
Yes, the Gu Xiaoli

355
00:22:07,250 --> 00:22:09,650
who lived across from you
when we were kids.

356
00:22:16,580 --> 00:22:17,650
Here's the chicken soup.

357
00:22:17,650 --> 00:22:19,110
Here, put it here. Come on.

358
00:22:19,900 --> 00:22:20,900
Come, eat.

359
00:22:21,290 --> 00:22:21,970
Okay.

360
00:22:22,620 --> 00:22:23,620
Have some more.

361
00:22:23,700 --> 00:22:25,830
Help yourself to some dishes, Xiaoli.

362
00:22:26,970 --> 00:22:28,730
Xiaoli, it's been years

363
00:22:28,730 --> 00:22:30,930
since you've had food made by me, right?

364
00:22:31,770 --> 00:22:32,450
Look,

365
00:22:32,730 --> 00:22:34,050
stir-fried pork with green peppers,

366
00:22:34,050 --> 00:22:36,050
and this eggplant with minced pork—

367
00:22:36,100 --> 00:22:37,620
they're all your favorites.

368
00:22:37,620 --> 00:22:38,380
Eat up.

369
00:22:38,380 --> 00:22:38,970
Okay.

370
00:22:40,900 --> 00:22:41,620
Xiaoli,

371
00:22:42,450 --> 00:22:44,100
make yourself at home.

372
00:22:44,690 --> 00:22:45,550
Have some food.

373
00:22:45,900 --> 00:22:46,580
Okay.

374
00:22:47,250 --> 00:22:48,110
Here, Mr. Zhou.

375
00:22:49,770 --> 00:22:51,160
By the way, Xiaoli,

376
00:22:51,180 --> 00:22:52,380
how are your parents?

377
00:22:54,210 --> 00:22:56,490
My parents have already divorced.

378
00:22:56,870 --> 00:22:57,860
I live with my mom now.

379
00:22:57,860 --> 00:22:58,860
She's doing well.

380
00:23:07,180 --> 00:23:08,180
There, it's fine.

381
00:23:08,180 --> 00:23:09,860
Eat more. Here, try this.

382
00:23:11,250 --> 00:23:14,090
Xiaoli, since you came
all the way to Kunzhou,

383
00:23:14,120 --> 00:23:15,920
you should've just told us.

384
00:23:16,690 --> 00:23:17,490
Exactly.

385
00:23:17,490 --> 00:23:18,950
And you, Zhou Xiangxiang,

386
00:23:19,400 --> 00:23:21,370
you two were so close
when you were little.

387
00:23:21,370 --> 00:23:22,830
If you two are dating,

388
00:23:23,100 --> 00:23:24,630
would your dad and I object?

389
00:23:25,180 --> 00:23:26,490
Keeping it all hidden,

390
00:23:26,660 --> 00:23:28,790
we almost misunderstood everything.

391
00:23:29,050 --> 00:23:32,180
They looked like they were going
to eat us alive just now.

392
00:23:32,210 --> 00:23:34,010
No, Mr. and Mrs. Zhou,

393
00:23:34,010 --> 00:23:36,450
I was only planning to stay a few days,

394
00:23:36,580 --> 00:23:38,380
so I didn't intend to bother you.

395
00:23:39,100 --> 00:23:40,160
Not a bother at all.

396
00:23:40,290 --> 00:23:41,970
Seeing you and Xiangxiang together

397
00:23:41,970 --> 00:23:42,970
makes me so happy.

398
00:23:43,380 --> 00:23:44,010
Come on.

399
00:23:46,050 --> 00:23:46,770
Today,

400
00:23:47,180 --> 00:23:49,180
let's drink to our hearts' content.

401
00:23:50,100 --> 00:23:50,770
Hey,

402
00:23:50,940 --> 00:23:51,860
let me make it clear—

403
00:23:51,860 --> 00:23:53,860
we eat first, then drink.

404
00:23:54,180 --> 00:23:54,860
It's fine.

405
00:23:56,690 --> 00:23:57,890
I remember back then,

406
00:23:58,180 --> 00:24:00,940
when our neighbor Mr. Li
was making his infused liquor,

407
00:24:00,940 --> 00:24:03,800
you stared with wide eyes,
saying you wanted a taste.

408
00:24:03,800 --> 00:24:05,200
He let you take a tiny sip.

409
00:24:06,050 --> 00:24:06,940
Guess what?

410
00:24:07,820 --> 00:24:08,690
I remember.

411
00:24:08,970 --> 00:24:09,970
His little face

412
00:24:09,970 --> 00:24:11,500
scrunched up immediately.

413
00:24:12,380 --> 00:24:13,580
So adorable.

414
00:24:14,340 --> 00:24:15,530
Dad, Dad.

415
00:24:16,180 --> 00:24:17,100
If you really want to drink,

416
00:24:17,100 --> 00:24:18,160
just have a little.

417
00:24:18,450 --> 00:24:19,930
Right. Don't overdo it.

418
00:24:20,920 --> 00:24:23,220
Today, I...

419
00:24:25,100 --> 00:24:25,780
Cheers.

420
00:24:26,730 --> 00:24:28,490
-You're chugging it.
-No, no.

421
00:24:30,770 --> 00:24:32,050
Take it easy.

422
00:24:40,100 --> 00:24:42,540
Xiao... Xiaoli.

423
00:24:44,490 --> 00:24:45,860
This is baijiu.

424
00:24:45,860 --> 00:24:47,180
Are you okay?

425
00:24:49,450 --> 00:24:50,420
Come. Have some food.

426
00:24:50,420 --> 00:24:51,580
Eat, have more.

427
00:24:55,210 --> 00:24:56,100
Xiaoli,

428
00:24:57,100 --> 00:24:58,010
back then,

429
00:24:58,250 --> 00:25:00,180
when you came to our house for meals,

430
00:25:00,180 --> 00:25:01,660
you were only this tall.

431
00:25:02,210 --> 00:25:03,770
Now you're literally

432
00:25:04,450 --> 00:25:05,530
taller than

433
00:25:05,860 --> 00:25:07,420
our Xiangxiang

434
00:25:08,180 --> 00:25:09,530
by more than a head.

435
00:25:10,100 --> 00:25:11,820
Time flies so fast.

436
00:25:15,690 --> 00:25:18,420
Well, Mr. and Mrs. Zhou,

437
00:25:20,520 --> 00:25:21,720
let me toast you both.

438
00:25:25,210 --> 00:25:27,450
You two took care of me when I was little.

439
00:25:28,180 --> 00:25:29,180
It's only now

440
00:25:29,290 --> 00:25:31,750
that I have the chance
to properly thank you.

441
00:25:31,800 --> 00:25:32,880
So this glass,

442
00:25:34,190 --> 00:25:35,360
I'll down it.

443
00:25:37,450 --> 00:25:38,180
No need.

444
00:25:38,480 --> 00:25:39,240
It's fine.

445
00:25:45,420 --> 00:25:46,660
Stop drinking.

446
00:25:48,690 --> 00:25:50,240
Stop drinking.

447
00:25:50,530 --> 00:25:51,420
Leave me alone.

448
00:25:55,970 --> 00:25:56,770
Xiaoli.

449
00:25:57,420 --> 00:25:58,680
Since you were little,

450
00:25:59,050 --> 00:26:01,730
you used to call me Dad,

451
00:26:02,730 --> 00:26:03,770
remember?

452
00:26:10,690 --> 00:26:11,660
In the future,

453
00:26:12,420 --> 00:26:14,140
when you two get married,

454
00:26:14,180 --> 00:26:16,490
you won't even need to switch
how you address us.

455
00:26:16,490 --> 00:26:17,180
Come on.

456
00:26:19,580 --> 00:26:20,100
Cheers.

457
00:26:20,290 --> 00:26:21,010
Cheers.

458
00:26:21,940 --> 00:26:22,610
Thank you, Dad.

459
00:26:22,610 --> 00:26:24,130
No, no, no, brother.

460
00:26:24,150 --> 00:26:25,280
From today on,

461
00:26:25,310 --> 00:26:26,590
you are my big brother.

462
00:26:26,970 --> 00:26:28,940
They're drunk, completely drunk.

463
00:26:29,180 --> 00:26:31,510
Now they're calling each other brothers.

464
00:26:38,290 --> 00:26:39,140
Xiaoli.

465
00:26:40,970 --> 00:26:42,420
I can't hold my liquor.

466
00:26:45,750 --> 00:26:46,750
He's the same?

467
00:26:47,840 --> 00:26:49,170
About the same as my dad.

468
00:26:51,760 --> 00:26:52,840
Oh, no.

469
00:26:52,970 --> 00:26:54,570
A whole table of food wasted.

470
00:28:15,450 --> 00:28:16,140
Mom.

471
00:28:16,860 --> 00:28:17,720
Where is Gu Han?

472
00:28:19,940 --> 00:28:21,870
He went out shopping with your dad.

473
00:28:22,180 --> 00:28:23,180
Honestly.

474
00:28:23,340 --> 00:28:24,690
He came to our house,

475
00:28:24,730 --> 00:28:26,790
and you didn't even keep him company.

476
00:28:30,490 --> 00:28:31,340
Xiaoli.

477
00:28:32,340 --> 00:28:33,740
Xiaoli, come in quickly.

478
00:28:34,050 --> 00:28:34,860
You're back.

479
00:28:35,140 --> 00:28:35,820
Dad.

480
00:28:36,860 --> 00:28:37,770
You must be hot.

481
00:28:38,010 --> 00:28:38,490
I'm fine.

482
00:28:38,490 --> 00:28:39,220
Xiangxiang.

483
00:28:39,340 --> 00:28:40,900
Help Xiaoli with the things.

484
00:28:40,900 --> 00:28:42,580
Xiangxiang,
bring those groceries into the kitchen.

485
00:28:42,580 --> 00:28:43,380
Come.

486
00:28:44,210 --> 00:28:44,900
Come.

487
00:28:45,210 --> 00:28:45,900
I'll do it.

488
00:28:48,140 --> 00:28:50,050
Why are you wearing my dad's clothes?

489
00:28:50,050 --> 00:28:51,510
Your mom made me wear them.

490
00:28:53,560 --> 00:28:54,250
Let's go.

491
00:29:13,860 --> 00:29:14,690
Here, here.

492
00:29:34,770 --> 00:29:35,450
Thank you.

493
00:29:50,340 --> 00:29:51,620
Yeah, look.

494
00:29:54,770 --> 00:29:55,770
Interesting.

495
00:30:00,530 --> 00:30:01,390
Stuff these in.

496
00:30:02,730 --> 00:30:03,970
I think that's about it.

497
00:30:03,970 --> 00:30:04,620
Right.

498
00:30:08,100 --> 00:30:09,420
If you want any local specialties
in the future,

499
00:30:09,420 --> 00:30:10,380
we'll send them to you.

500
00:30:10,380 --> 00:30:11,100
No problem.

501
00:30:11,490 --> 00:30:13,620
Say hello to your mom when you get back.

502
00:30:13,860 --> 00:30:14,770
Okay, I will.

503
00:30:16,660 --> 00:30:18,100
Drive safely on the way.

504
00:30:18,210 --> 00:30:18,900
Okay.

505
00:30:22,250 --> 00:30:22,940
Let's go.

506
00:30:24,940 --> 00:30:25,610
Goodbye.

507
00:30:35,470 --> 00:30:37,190
Be safe on the road.

508
00:30:37,470 --> 00:30:38,140
I will.

509
00:30:39,210 --> 00:30:40,530
Eat on time every day.

510
00:30:40,860 --> 00:30:41,580
I know.

511
00:30:41,690 --> 00:30:44,140
And don't just binge‑watch
game highlight reels.

512
00:30:44,140 --> 00:30:45,600
Make sure you take breaks.

513
00:30:47,180 --> 00:30:48,580
What are you laughing at?

514
00:30:50,010 --> 00:30:51,180
Now who's the nag?

515
00:30:57,050 --> 00:30:58,310
Hurry up and go inside.

516
00:30:58,420 --> 00:31:00,020
I'll go back and wait for you.

517
00:31:12,010 --> 00:31:12,690
Go ahead.

518
00:31:22,460 --> 00:31:23,820
You get in the car first.

519
00:31:41,290 --> 00:31:42,020
I'm leaving.

520
00:31:53,860 --> 00:31:56,140
[Jiangcheng University]

521
00:32:03,250 --> 00:32:05,180
Girls, I'm back!

522
00:32:05,180 --> 00:32:08,250
Xiangxiang! I missed you so much!

523
00:32:08,250 --> 00:32:09,530
I missed you too.

524
00:32:09,530 --> 00:32:10,180
Where are the others?

525
00:32:10,180 --> 00:32:11,880
They went out to eat.

526
00:32:12,210 --> 00:32:15,410
These are local specialties
my parents sent for you guys.

527
00:32:15,690 --> 00:32:17,320
Thanks to your mom and dad.

528
00:32:17,530 --> 00:32:19,760
By the way,
didn't Gu Han go to your house?

529
00:32:19,760 --> 00:32:21,500
Tell me, how did it go?

530
00:32:22,160 --> 00:32:23,020
Don't even ask.

531
00:32:23,860 --> 00:32:25,730
What's wrong? Did it not go well?

532
00:32:25,730 --> 00:32:27,490
It went too well.

533
00:32:27,730 --> 00:32:29,390
He was only there for two days.

534
00:32:29,450 --> 00:32:31,940
My parents already treat him
like their own son.

535
00:32:31,940 --> 00:32:34,470
It's like I'm not even
their real kid anymore.

536
00:32:34,530 --> 00:32:35,390
Where's Sirui?

537
00:32:36,100 --> 00:32:38,290
He came back early.

538
00:32:38,290 --> 00:32:40,750
He said his internship company
is very busy.

539
00:32:41,530 --> 00:32:43,450
Since I came back,

540
00:32:43,530 --> 00:32:44,930
I haven't seen him at all.

541
00:32:47,050 --> 00:32:48,250
Let's talk later.

542
00:32:48,250 --> 00:32:49,900
The campus TV station is recruiting today.

543
00:32:49,900 --> 00:32:52,530
And I need to go check in with Gu Han.

544
00:32:54,340 --> 00:32:55,050
I'm leaving.

545
00:32:55,050 --> 00:32:56,140
Go, go, go.

546
00:32:56,490 --> 00:32:57,420
So lovey-dovey.

547
00:32:59,660 --> 00:33:01,620
Your parents let you come back to school
this soon?

548
00:33:01,620 --> 00:33:03,340
It was fine for the first few days,

549
00:33:03,340 --> 00:33:04,530
but then they got impatient

550
00:33:04,530 --> 00:33:06,530
and couldn't wait to send me
back to school.

551
00:33:06,530 --> 00:33:07,340
Are you sure

552
00:33:07,900 --> 00:33:09,430
they weren't thinking of me

553
00:33:09,660 --> 00:33:11,100
and specifically sent you back first?

554
00:33:11,100 --> 00:33:13,450
We have the most professional
and advanced technology,

555
00:33:13,450 --> 00:33:15,210
as well as a strong faculty team.

556
00:33:15,210 --> 00:33:16,940
-Did you miss me?
-Come join us.

557
00:33:17,140 --> 00:33:18,670
We are waiting for you here.

558
00:33:21,610 --> 00:33:22,460
Every day.

559
00:33:26,690 --> 00:33:28,420
-Xiangxiang, Gu Han.
-Long time no see.

560
00:33:28,420 --> 00:33:29,210
-Long time no see.
-Hello.

561
00:33:29,000 --> 00:33:31,250
[JCU Campus TV Station]

562
00:33:29,210 --> 00:33:30,380
-Hello.
-Hello.

563
00:33:30,600 --> 00:33:31,770
Later, copy the information from this form

564
00:33:31,250 --> 00:33:35,470
[Jiangcheng University]

565
00:33:31,770 --> 00:33:32,770
-onto this form.
-Here.

566
00:33:32,770 --> 00:33:34,300
Then hand it to the teacher.

567
00:33:34,660 --> 00:33:36,250
Make two extra copies, thanks.

568
00:33:36,250 --> 00:33:37,490
Come, rest here for a bit.

569
